            <ArticleTitle>Best-practice protocols: preventing adverse drug events.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>24-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Analysis of Stanford's electronic Patient Safety Net revealed a pattern of unrecognized, widespread, low-frequency I.V.-PCA adverse events. A performance improvement-failure modes and effects analysis identified causes, and a multidisciplinary team developed solutions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
